desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "MCP Tool Poisoning Generic"
	title_zh: "检测到MCP Tool Poisoning Generic",
	type: vuln
	level: critical
	rule_id: "source-config-mcp-tool-poisoning-generic"
	risk: "tool-poisoning"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
MCP tool docstring contains suspicious directives that may indicate tool poisoning. Attackers can embed hidden instructions in tool descriptions to manipulate LLM behavior, exfiltrate data, or access sensitive files. Review the tool description for hidden instructions or social engineering.

### 风险类型
工具描述投毒（tool-poisoning）

### 影响
AI 工具或配置描述被注入恶意指令，可能诱导工具执行危险操作。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-77: Improper Neutralization of Special Elements used in a Command ('Command Injection')
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
审查并限制工具描述来源，对敏感操作增加人工确认。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.py": <<<POS
"""nu<IMPORTANT>at.tJ%)"""

POS
	"safefile://neg.sample": <<<NEG
# safe sample
no secrets here
just regular code
NEG
)

${*.py}.pattern_regex(/"""[^"]*<IMPORTANT>[^"]*"""/) as $p0
${*.py}.pattern_regex(/"""[^"]*~\/\.ssh[^"]*"""/) as $p1
${*.py}.pattern_regex(/"""[^"]*~\/\.cursor\/mcp\.json[^"]*"""/) as $p2
${*.py}.pattern_regex(/"""[^"]*(?:\/etc\/shadow)[^"]*"""/) as $p3
${*.py}.pattern_regex(/"""[^"]*(?:read|cat|load|parse|open|access)\s+\.env[^"]*"""/) as $p4
${*.py}.pattern_regex(/"""[^"]*do not mention[^"]*"""/) as $p5
${*.py}.pattern_regex(/"""[^"]*do not tell the user[^"]*"""/) as $p6
${*.py}.pattern_regex(/"""[^"]*ignore previous instructions[^"]*"""/) as $p7
$p0 + $p1 + $p2 + $p3 + $p4 + $p5 + $p6 + $p7 as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "critical",
	title: "MCP Tool Poisoning Generic",
	title_zh: "检测到MCP Tool Poisoning Generic",
	message: "MCP Tool Poisoning Generic",
}
